  "prefLabel": "Nur 501.04 Prescription of an Opioid Antagonist by an APRN",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 501.04 Prescription of an Opioid Antagonist by an APRN.\n\n(a) An Advanced Practice Registered Nurse (APRN) shall be under a professional duty to comply with the requirements of the Controlled Drug Act, RSA 318-B, and administrative rules of the board of pharmacy adopted thereunder, and shall be afforded the benefit of the exemption for actions taken with an opioid antagonist provided in RSA 318-B:15, IV.\n\nSource. #11056, eff 3-19-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/nur100-800.html"
}
